   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If I Lose**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-04-12.schoepsMK41v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 80 min [1]\n- **billystrings2019-04-12.AKG414**: source not stated; 16 songs; 79 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were placed about two feet in front of the right PA stack [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-04-12.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>kcy>vst>SDMP6 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41V microphones with KCY cables into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24-bit/96kHz; Transferred via Sony Sound Forge Pro 11 with fades and iZotope dithering to 16-bit/44.1kHz, then CDWAV tracking, then FLAC via Trader's Little Helper [1]\n- **billystrings2019-04-12.AKG414**: taped by Keith Antaya; transferred by Keith Antaya; source: AKG414>V3>F8 [2]",
